      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.421142578125,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "available urine LF-LAM test endorsed by WHO. Details on the use of LF-LAM are provided in the TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        549.3824462890625,
        352.8045959472656,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic guidelines   and accompanying handbook  .  (14) (39)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
