      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4234008789062,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "a systematic review to summarize the current scientific literature on the accuracy of AlereLAM for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.41796875,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "the diagnosis of TB in people living with HIV. The review identified 15 unique published studies",
